      "word_first": "W001663",
      "word_last": "W001754",
      "text": "I will be straight with you about my own position. I have never sold a business. I have no transaction experience and this episode is not going to pretend otherwise. What I have done is be the single point of failure in businesses I ran, which is the exact condition this practice removes. So I know what it looks like from the inside. I do not know what it looks like across a closing table, and where this gets near deal mechanics I am going to hand you to people who do.",
